WEBVTT

00:31.095 --> 00:35.396
Heard life to be cut across the rain

00:39.117 --> 00:43.258
Wipers keep the beat on the windowpane

00:46.099 --> 00:54.701
Static on the radio fading in and out We're just

00:54.821 --> 00:58.782
shadows in the dashboard lights

01:03.001 --> 01:07.222
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

01:07.623 --> 01:11.364
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms The

01:11.484 --> 01:18.506
city's just a map of glowing, faded lines But I'm

01:18.586 --> 01:22.787
safe right here, between your eyes and mine

01:25.448 --> 01:30.570
Midnight drivers, and the fading lights

01:46.175 --> 01:50.376
The skyline's a promise cold and blue I

01:54.456 --> 02:02.398
don't know this road, but I'm with you The analog

02:02.478 --> 02:09.859
display is a steady green glow Got no

02:09.939 --> 02:14.120
destination, just a place to go

02:18.128 --> 02:22.610
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

02:22.710 --> 02:26.592
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms The

02:26.712 --> 02:34.136
city's just a map of glowing faded lines But I'm

02:34.296 --> 02:39.098
safe right here between your eyes and mine

02:41.479 --> 02:46.582
Midnight drivers in the fading light

02:53.224 --> 02:55.870
In the fading light

